{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1458638712"}, "name":{"label":"Karen Finkle"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-21T08:05:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.23"}, "id":{"label":"13871823512"}, "title":{"label":"Good-But.."}, "content":{"label":"Imposter Who is a great game! My friends and I have a wonderful time playing it but there are some flaws.\n\nWhile it's easy to play and the app is very navigable, it can get boring. When you do the same exact thing over and over again it can become kind of annoying. \n\nPlaying it the first couple of times is SO fun but after a bit, you and your opponents can get tired of it. \n\nSo maybe if there were some other aspects to the game other than trying to find the imposter? Perhaps if there was a version that was more complex and included things such as challenging the imposter to answer a specific question about someone in the group or and score of points for who guessed the imposter right.\n\nExcept for that, the game is very fun and a good way to use up time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6746781192&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
